        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Furnace, logs, mixed, 30kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Furnace, logs, mixed, 30kW
Assumed lifetime: furnace 15 years;
UUID: de2c4ed7-d066-36f7-a87e-8e880f9e74f1
Includes the most important materials used for the fabrication of the furnace, the water storage, and the chimney: steel, concrete, rock wool, aluminum, cast iron, plastics, lubricating oil. Also includes the surface for furnace and wood storage, transports and energy used for the construction and the disposal of the furnace.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Boiler of average technology available on market. 
Time period: Some data used to calculate averages are from the second half of the 1990´s.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature, personal communication 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_de2c4ed7-d066-36f7-a87e-8e880f9e74f1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
